            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"relativistic-kinematics-and-jet-clustering\">Relativistic kinematics and jet clustering</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">FeynKit's Python kinematics use double precision, caller-defined energy units, component order <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((E,p_x,p_y,p_z)||)</marimo-tex>, and the mostly-minus metric <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||((+,-,-,-)||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
